# This is the first Debian revision of the package in the Radxa archive;
# project packaging is not tied to a Debian BTS issue.
initial-upload-closes-no-bugs

# Upstream intentionally ships the API, session, and utility SONAMEs as one
# tightly-coupled Sensing Hub runtime package.
package-name-doesnt-match-sonames

# This package ships arch-dependent content (an arm64 executable plus shared
# libraries under the multiarch triplet directory) while being declared
# Architecture: all for consistency with the other Radxa packaging
# repositories. Every tag below follows from that single mismatch, so they are
# suppressed together. Switching the package to Architecture: arm64 is the
# alternative, but that diverges from the Radxa template.
arch-independent-package-contains-binary-or-object
triplet-dir-and-architecture-mismatch
unstripped-binary-or-object
no-shlibs
lacks-ldconfig-trigger
undeclared-elf-prerequisites
